// Regression: SiphonStreak.kill_count must be zero when Siphon is not in ActiveProtocols.
//
// Contract: the Siphon protocol owns SiphonStreak. Any code path that removes Siphon from
// ActiveProtocols (node exit, run reset, explicit deactivation) MUST clear SiphonStreak to
// its default state. If kill_count remains > 0 after removal, the SiphonStreakOrphaned
// invariant fires.
//
// This scenario exercises the normal Siphon lifecycle under chaos input:
//   — Siphon is injected at frame 10 via InjectProtocol.
//   — Chaos input with allow_early_end: false drives sustained cell destruction in Dense
//     layout, accumulating kill_count in SiphonStreak via Destroyed<Cell> messages.
//   — Node restarts trigger siphon_cleanup_node (OnExit NodeState::Playing) and
//     reset_run_state, both of which must reset SiphonStreak.
//   — SiphonStreakOrphaned asserts kill_count == 0 whenever Siphon is absent from
//     ActiveProtocols.
//
// Failure mode this protects against:
//   If siphon_cleanup_node races with a Destroyed<Cell> message buffered from the final
//   tick of the dying node, the cleanup may fire before the message is processed, leaving
//   kill_count == 0 — which is correct. But if the ordering is reversed (message processed
//   after cleanup), kill_count > 0 survives into the new node. Separately, if a future
//   refactor removes the SiphonStreak reset from siphon_cleanup_node or reset_run_state,
//   kill_count compounds across nodes, causing the first kill of each new node to follow
//   the continuation path (emitting ReverseTimePenalty) rather than starting a new streak.
//   The SiphonStreakOrphaned invariant is the only catch for this class of state leak.
(
    breaker: "Aegis",
    layout: "Dense",
    input: Chaos((action_prob: 0.7)),
    max_frames: 3000,
    disallowed_failures: [
        NoNaN,
        BoltInBounds,
        BreakerInBounds,
        BoltSpeedAccurate,
        ValidDashState,
        BreakerCountReasonable,
        NoEntityLeaks,
        BoltCountReasonable,
        SiphonStreakOrphaned,
    ],
    allowed_failures: None,
    debug_setup: None,
    allow_early_end: false,
    seed: 3381,
    frame_mutations: [
        (frame: 10, mutation: InjectProtocol(kind_name: "Siphon")),
    ],
)
